{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "cap-title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1300,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 230,
   "text": "# Qwen3.8-Flash-Next — model  \n`Qwen4ExpForConditionalGeneration` (model_type `qwen4_exp`), Qwen's experimental preview of the Qwen4 architecture. One continuous decoder stack L0–47, read top → bottom; layers that repeat are drawn once with **×N**. **Grey bars = tensors**, length ∝ channels per token (0.08 px/channel); **boxes = operations**. T = sequence length. *Layer* tab = one layer in detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-legend",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 450,
   "y": -1300,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 230,
   "text": "Layer rows — **Gated DeltaNet** (36 layers, linear attention, fixed-size state) · **QSA attention** (12, every 4th: softmax over the top 2048 tokens an indexer picks in 4-token blocks) · **pink** = the one DeltaNet layer that also adds hashed n-gram embeddings (PLE). Every layer: MoE **10 of 512** experts + 1 shared.    \nThe residual stream is **4 lanes × 2560 = 10240** wide; blocks read it and write back through gated residuals. Layer ≈ **2.59B** (DeltaNet) / **2.59B** (QSA). All weights BF16."
  },
  {
   "id": "raw1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -960,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**raw text**  \"The cat sat…\"",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
