   "type": "text",
   "x": 2600,
   "y": 636,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**pre_fc_norm_hidden** (per lane) → **fc_hidden** 2560→2560  \n6.6M",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "mtp-emb",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3150,
   "y": 636,
   "width": 340,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "embed(token t+1) → **pre_fc_norm_embedding → fc_embedding** 2560→2560 · 6.6M",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "mlane37",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2340,
   "y": 740,
   "width": 819,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl38",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1880,
   "y": 730,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`[T, 10240]  lanes for the MTP layer`"
  },
  {
   "id": "mly39",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2600,
   "y": 794,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "**1 layer**: gated residuals + QSA attention + MoE 10/512  \n2.59B",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "mhd40",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2600,
   "y": 898,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**lane mixer → shared lm head**  \n6.6M",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "mdr41",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2600,
   "y": 994,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**draft token t+2** → verified by the main model",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-mtp",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2600,
   "y": 1090,
   "width": 600,
   "height": 190,
   "text": "Multi-token prediction head (2.61B, 1 layer, config `mtp.hybrid: true`). Not in transformers (its loader drops `mtp.*`): wiring is read off the tensor names. pre_fc_norm_hidden is 10240 wide, so it takes the 4-lane state; how the two fc outputs are combined is not public. No own embed / head — it reuses the main ones."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-new",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": 1400,
   "width": 1300,
   "height": 260,
   "text": "**New vs Qwen3.5 / Qwen3.8** (same 3 : 1 DeltaNet / attention rhythm, same 512-expert MoE and ViT):\n- **gated residual**: 4 residual lanes (10240 wide) read / written through learned gates\n- **QSA**: attention layers see only top-2048 tokens chosen in 4-token blocks by an indexer\n- **n-gram PLE**: a 51.20B hashed bigram/trigram table feeding L1\n- DeltaNet output gate sigmoid instead of SiLU; no standalone RMSNorms"
  },
  {
   "id": "cap-bpt",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1766,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 40,
   "text": "**Where the parameters are stored** — total 180.00B"
  },
  {
   "id": "bp0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -900,
   "y": -1720,
   "width": 1745,
   "height": 44,
   "text": "**routed experts (512/layer)**",
