   "x": -900,
   "y": -1670,
   "width": 2600,
   "height": 64,
   "text": "routed experts (512/layer) **120.80B** (67.1%) · n-gram embedding (L1) **51.20B** (28.4%) · Gated DeltaNet ×36 **2.09B** (1.2%) · MTP **2.61B** (1.4%) · shared expert + router **299.0M** (0.2%) · QSA attention ×12 **597.7M** (0.3%) · QSA indexers ×12 **19.7M** (<0.1%) · gated residuals ×97 **640.6M** (0.4%) · PLE projections + conv **32.8M** (<0.1%) · embed **635.7M** (0.4%) · lm head **635.7M** (0.4%) · ViT + merger **448.9M** (0.2%)"
  },
  {
