   "text": "routed experts (512/layer) **2.36B** (35.4%) · shared expert + router **299.0M** (4.5%) · Gated DeltaNet ×36 **2.09B** (31.3%) · QSA attention ×12 **597.7M** (9.0%) · gated residuals ×97 **640.6M** (9.6%) · lm head **635.7M** (9.5%) · n-gram embedding (L1) **0** (row lookup) · QSA indexers ×12 **19.7M** (0.3%) · PLE projections + conv **32.8M** (0.5%) · embed **0** (row lookup) · MTP **0** (only when drafting) · ViT + merger **0** (runs per image)"
